# month

- _month(d)_

Answer the ordinal (one-indexed) month of the date _d_.

```
>>> Date(1970, 1, 1).month
1

>>> '2024-03-04'.parseDate.month
3
```

* * *

See also: asDate, Date, dayOfMonth, minute, parseDate, year

